```
Multiply, then divide, then add `p->x`. `/ 2` (compilers legally rewrite as `* 0.5`; bit-identical).

### 1.10 `sectorContainsSector`

```
bool sectorContainsSector(const Node* m, const Node* p) {
    return area(m->prev, m, p->prev) < 0 && area(p->next, m, m->next) < 0;
}
```
`m` is the MIDDLE argument in both; both strict `< 0`.

### 1.11 `isValidDiagonal`

```
bool isValidDiagonal(Node* a, Node* b) {
    return a->next->i != b->i && a->prev->i != b->i && !intersectsPolygon(a, b) &&
           ( ( locallyInside(a, b) && locallyInside(b, a) && middleInside(a, b) &&
               (area(a->prev, a, b->prev) != 0 || area(a, b->prev, b) != 0) )   // no opposite-facing sectors
