Grouping is `A && B && C && (D || E)`. Note both sector-areas use `b->prev` (never `b->next`); both zero-length areas use strict `> 0`.

### 1.12 `insertNode`

```
Node* insertNode(std::size_t i, const Point& pt, Node* last) {
    Node* p = nodes.construct(static_cast<N>(i), nth<0>(pt), nth<1>(pt));
    if (!last) { p->prev = p; p->next = p; }
    else {
        p->next = last->next;
        p->prev = last;
        last->next->prev = p;     // must read last->next BEFORE the next line
        last->next = p;
    }
